ded Special Thanks to the credits+ Updated Linux build to this version= Changed the start and end screens- Fixed a bug in the menu- Fixed a bug in the tablet- Fixed a bug in the cafeteria- General minor fixesI've also made some progress on the French translation, but that's taking a lot more time than I'd expected.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:11:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028821","verified_at":"2026-10-21T17:11:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4121110-1846651706692119","game_id":"steam-4121110","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest: PROLOGUE PHASE 1/4 RELEASED!","summary":"IT'S HERE. IT'S FINALLY HERE. EVERYONE HAS BEEN WAITING FOR IT. EXCEPT YOU. GET WITH THE TIMES ALREADY, WOW.This update adds 30 to 120 minutes of content to the demo.I really hope you'll enjoy it! This is only a fraction of what I've got planned for the full game, just enough to set the characters up for the upcoming content. Some of it is still a little rough around the edges, and the French translation isn't done yet. I'm a solo indie dev, this is tough. Phase 2 to 4 will be released in the co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:20:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692119","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4121110-1830797770234563","game_id":"steam-4121110","kind":"announcement","title":"LINUX SUPPORT","summary":"Hello everybody! I don't even know if this will show up. I'm really just testing a bunch of stuff out right now. The original plan was to have patches/updates every week, but that quickly fell through partly because of personal reasons, but mostly because I've rethought the entire game's direction. This current update is only for Linux users, but it'll come to Windows very soon. There's a Discord server now, by the way! Join us here: https://discord.gg/uBxYHEEbah Anyway, here's the patch log so ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-23T23:54:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770234563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4121110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4121110":"2026-10-26T01:46:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4121110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4121340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
